data: {"id": "4147dc782df34ddf-thinking-parallel_evidence-421", "run_id": "4147dc782df34ddf", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "`describe` 结果已经给出了非常明确的信息：\n1.  **Pod 状态**：`Pending`，`node: <none>`。\n2.  **事件**：`FailedScheduling`，原因是 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`。\n3.  **调度约束**：`Node-Selectors: aiops.lab/unavailable=true`。\n4.  **资源请求**：`cpu: 5m, memory: 8Mi`（极低，说明不是资源不足问题）。\n\n这已经直接指向了根因：**节点选择器/亲和性不匹配**。但我还需要获取节点的状态来确认是否确实没有节点拥有 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 这个标签，以此作为最终闭环证据。\n\n继续执行 `get nodes` 和 `events` 确认：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788763950523, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

