event: thinking
data: {"id": "4147dc782df34ddf-thinking-parallel_evidence-1219", "run_id": "4147dc782df34ddf", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "所有证据已采集完毕。\n\n### 证据结论\n\n**实体身份**：\n*   **Pod**: `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52`\n*   **UID**: `78de30b1-06ec-4314-9120-26d93c29a48a`\n*   **控制器**: Deployment `workload` -> ReplicaSet `workload-68c557d875`\n\n**支持候选原因的证据 (PendingUnschedulable / Node Selector 不匹配)**：\n1.  **调度事件**：Pod 持续触发 `Warning FailedScheduling`，完整 Message 为：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.`\n2.  **调度约束**：Pod 定义了 `Node-Selectors: aiops.lab/unavailable=true`。\n3.  **节点状态**：集群内 3 个节点", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788763964450, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "4147dc782df34ddf-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "4147dc782df34ddf", "seq": 1220, "ts_ms": 1788763973022, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 48.765, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-01", "name": "workload-68c557d875-bsq52"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/4147dc782df34ddf-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "e2697e858cbd952004055c05382836bb9b9eca9ea5661c57f75507dc66cf0a65", "bytes": 2633}, "snapshot_sha256": "ae8a14baec99e6123c064fc023c21684d95863d79b0d11b4f4458407f950a67c"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "4147dc782df34ddf-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "4147dc782df34ddf", "seq": 1221, "ts_ms": 1788763973023, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "4147dc782df34ddf-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "4147dc782df34ddf", "seq": 1222, "ts_ms": 1788763980590, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.567, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1453, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod workload-68c557d875-bsq52 in namespace aiops-case-01 remains in Pending status due to scheduling failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning FailedScheduling: \"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector...\" | 直接证明调度失败原因是节点亲和性/选择器不匹配 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod status: Pending | 确认 Pod 始终未调度成功 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | resource_request.cpu: 5m, memory: 8Mi | 资源请求值极低，说明资源充足，排除资源不足导致的调度失败 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | resource_limit.cpu: 50m, memory: 32Mi | 确认资源限制值 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n- 事件 1 明确指出现象为 \"didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"，直接指向非资源类的调度约束问题。\n- 状态 2 佐证 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态，符合调度失败的典型表现。\n- 配置 3 和 4 证实 Pod 的资源请求非常低，排除了因资源不足（No Resources）导致 3 个节点均不可用的可能性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 包含 NodeSelector 约束 'aiops.lab/unavailable=true' → 调度器检查集群中 3 个节点，发现无节点满足该标签约束 → 调度器返回 '0/3 nodes are available' 并持续触发 FailedScheduling 事件 → Pod 保持在 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 **NodeSelector 约束 'aiops.lab/unavailable=true' 与集群节点标签不匹配**。\n该约束指定了 Pod 只能运行在带有 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签的节点上，但集群当前仅有的 3 个节点（master, node1, node2）均无此标签，导致调度器无法为 Pod 分配任何节点，从而使其长期处于 Pending 状态。\n这一结论由 K8s Event 中明确指出的 \"didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\" 以及 K8s State 中的 Pending 状态直接支撑。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod workload-68c557d875-bsq52 in namespace aiops-case-01 remains in Pending status due to scheduling failure |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning FailedScheduling: \"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector...\" | 直接证明调度失败原因是节点亲和性/选择器不匹配 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod status: Pending | 确认 Pod 始终未调度成功 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | resource_request.cpu: 5m, memory: 8Mi | 资源请求值极低，说明资源充足，排除资源不足导致的调度失败 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | resource_limit.cpu: 50m, memory: 32Mi | 确认资源限制值 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n- 事件 1 明确指出现象为 \"didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"，直接指向非资源类的调度约束问题。\n- 状态 2 佐证 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态，符合调度失败的典型表现。\n- 配置 3 和 4 证实 Pod 的资源请求非常低，排除了因资源不足（No Resources）导致 3 个节点均不可用的可能性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 包含 NodeSelector 约束 'aiops.lab/unavailable=true' → 调度器检查集群中 3 个节点，发现无节点满足该标签约束 → 调度器返回 '0/3 nodes are available' 并持续触发 FailedScheduling 事件 → Pod 保持在 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 **NodeSelector 约束 'aiops.lab/unavailable=true' 与集群节点标签不匹配**。\n该约束指定了 Pod 只能运行在带有 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签的节点上，但集群当前仅有的 3 个节点（master, node1, node2）均无此标签，导致调度器无法为 Pod 分配任何节点，从而使其长期处于 Pending 状态。\n这一结论由 K8s Event 中明确指出的 \"didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\" 以及 K8s State 中的 Pending 状态直接支撑。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

